WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.083
This would be an awesome
story to tell our kids.

00:00:02.167 --> 00:00:04.958
"I met your dad
in a social experiment."

00:00:05.042 --> 00:00:06.208
"I'm sorry. What, Mum?"

00:00:06.292 --> 00:00:07.292
Welcome to Love Is Blind!

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:29.167
I'm here because
I'm looking for the one.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:31.417
I haven't found someone
that appreciates my love

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:33.167
as much
as I appreciate theirs.

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:34.333
That's why I'm here.

00:00:42.292 --> 00:00:43.542
I'm ready for marriage,

00:00:43.625 --> 00:00:46.833
but I've never felt
true love in my life.

00:00:46.917 --> 00:00:48.625
I don't think I ever said
to anyone "I love you",

00:00:48.708 --> 00:00:49.833
except my mum.

00:01:02.375 --> 00:01:03.625
Looking forward

00:01:03.708 --> 00:01:07.458
to what potentially could be
discovered in these pods.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:11.875
The pods are
officially open.

00:01:11.958 --> 00:01:13.583
-Open!
-Here we go!

00:01:20.542 --> 00:01:22.000
Guys, there'll be
no devices.

00:01:22.083 --> 00:01:23.750
Zero distractions.

00:01:23.833 --> 00:01:26.167
The only time you guys
are gonna interact

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:27.667
are in the private pods.

00:01:35.042 --> 00:01:37.125
I'm putting my hand on
the wall. Can you see me?

00:01:37.208 --> 00:01:39.542
-No, I can't.
-Are you as nervous as I am?

00:01:39.625 --> 00:01:40.917
-Oh, my God.
-Hello?

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.458
Welcome to my pod.

00:01:44.958 --> 00:01:47.125
-I work in real estate.
-Do you sell a lot?

00:01:47.208 --> 00:01:49.250
'Cause I feel like you have
to be somewhat attractive

00:01:49.333 --> 00:01:50.667
to sell a lot.

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:52.958
I love buying clothes
for girls.

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:55.125
Now, what's your size?

00:01:55.750 --> 00:01:57.292
What the fuck?

00:02:06.417 --> 00:02:07.958
-You're my number one, so…
-Really?

00:02:08.042 --> 00:02:09.292
You were my number one too.

00:02:09.375 --> 00:02:11.000
Ooh, look at that.

00:02:19.333 --> 00:02:23.042
OK, never have I ever
had sex in a public place.

00:02:33.792 --> 00:02:35.333
I just wanna be by you.

00:02:35.417 --> 00:02:36.625
I know.

00:02:45.042 --> 00:02:46.125
Will you marry me?

00:02:46.208 --> 00:02:47.208
Will you marry me?

00:02:47.292 --> 00:02:48.500
Will you marry me?

00:03:10.583 --> 00:03:13.708
It's so crazy to see
all the couples together.

00:03:13.792 --> 00:03:15.333
Damn.
Everyone's so attractive.

00:03:15.417 --> 00:03:16.708
-This is…
-It's great.

00:03:16.792 --> 00:03:17.708
Yeah.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:33.208
We were gone
for almost three weeks.

00:03:33.292 --> 00:03:36.875
I'm like trying to bury
under a mountain of emails.

00:03:36.958 --> 00:03:38.750
Back to reality.

00:03:50.833 --> 00:03:52.083
-That was pathetic.
-That was not good.

00:03:52.167 --> 00:03:54.208
-Can I do that again?
-Yeah, you better.

00:03:54.292 --> 00:03:56.375
Now is the time to decide…

00:03:56.458 --> 00:03:58.167
…if love is truly blind.

00:04:19.958 --> 00:04:22.000
We did it. We're married.

00:04:23.083 --> 00:04:24.000
You're my husband.

00:04:30.667 --> 00:04:33.000
Oh, God. Oh, God. Oh, God.

